lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">企业微信正式开启AI Agent“大圆”内测，深度打通办公与客户经营生态</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">SpaceX正式发布Starmind项目，计划发射100万颗AI算力卫星构建全球算力闭环</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI在ChatGPT中测试Bidi1语音模型，支持双向实时对话交互</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">特斯拉中国车机系统接入豆包大模型，通过OTA升级实现交互体验智能化</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7fa12a0e42e62da916fc41462711390a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">特斯拉中国在2026年火山引擎原动力大会上宣布，其车载交互系统将通过OTA升级深度接入豆包大模型。此次更新重构了语音助手架构，采用“分工协作”模式：豆包AI负责空调、车窗及导航等硬件指令控制；DeepSeek则处理复杂对话问答，协助用户理解FSD全自动驾驶功能。车主可通过方向盘按键或语音指令“嘿，特斯拉”激活该功能。相较于传统指令式交互，接入大模型后的语音助手具备更强的语义理解与反馈能力，能提供更贴合本土语境的交互体验。目前该功能已在部分内测版本中上线，标志着AI大模型正加速向智能汽车这一核心算力场景渗透，为国内用户提供更灵敏的“数字副驾”服务。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">千问发布全球首个原生语言世界模型 Qwen-AgentWorld 及评测基准</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b7ccb6a0dbad806a9100002ff3b48b90.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月24日，千问正式发布全球首个原生语言世界模型（Language World Model）Qwen-AgentWorld。该模型突破了传统大模型仅限于文本处理的局限，实现了对代码与终端环境（如MCP、Search、Terminal、SWE）及GUI图形界面环境（如Web、OS、Android）的统一覆盖。通过跨环境的强悍掌控力，Qwen-AgentWorld能够高效进行知识迁移，推动AI从对话者向具备独立操作能力的行动者演进。同步推出的AgentWorldBench评测基准涵盖七大应用领域，所有测试样本均基于真实操作环境的观测数据，确保模型在复杂交互中的高效与准确。该技术的发布为开发者提供了更强大的底层工具，预示着AI在自动化业务处理及辅助办公场景中将实现更智能的交互体验，为构建全能型数字助理奠定了技术基础。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">企业微信正式开启AI Agent“大圆”内测，深度打通办公与客户经营生态</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/fa05a6bae71abbb5717605fe630b87f1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">企业微信日前正式开启AI Agent“大圆”内测，该产品作为原生嵌入企微生态的AI助理，旨在提升办公效率与客户经营能力。用户可通过在企微页面“向左轻滑”唤醒“大圆”，其能自动识别当前界面，并基于群聊、文档、会议、邮件及日程等沉淀数据，实现一键总结群聊、提炼报表结论及自动生成回复。在客户经营场景中，“大圆”可处理销售与客服的非结构化沟通记录，将其转化为客户画像、跟进摘要与经营洞察，解决私域流量经营依赖人工经验的痛点。目前企业微信已接入超1400万企业与组织，每日服务微信用户逾7.5亿。此次“大圆”的落地，标志着企业微信AI能力从协同办公向商业经营场景深度渗透，成为行业内少数同时具备“工作数据”与“客户连接”双重场景的AI Agent入口。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SpaceX正式发布Starmind项目，计划发射100万颗AI算力卫星构建全球算力闭环</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3fe9e758f58d23bcf483fe0019c7a1c6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">SpaceX正式公布轨道AI数据中心项目Starmind，计划发射100万颗搭载AI算力单元的卫星，旨在构建脱离地面机房限制的全球算力供给闭环。该项目首代硬件产品AI1单星设计高度20米，翼展达70米，单颗卫星可输出120kW至150kW的AI算力，性能等同于地面一座现代AI服务器机架。在技术架构上，Starmind卫星集群通过高速光链路实现互联互通，并依托星链网络将处理数据中继回地面，实现算力调度、太空通信与终端接入的完全打通。SpaceX已于今年1月底向美国联邦通信委员会提交落地申请。该计划若全面落地，将彻底改变传统AI算力依赖地面基础设施的模式，但百万颗卫星的轨道资源竞争及部署规模将对全球航天产业产生深远影响。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI在ChatGPT中测试Bidi1语音模型，支持双向实时对话交互</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97e0da57e2103d5ec8cf42c69e3ccbf6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日在ChatGPT网页端及App端开启了新型语音模型Bidi1的测试，标志着AI语音交互从线性“你问我答”向双向实时对话模式进化。Bidi1的核心技术在于“双向并行处理”，模型在输出语音的同时可实时监听用户输入，并支持在对话中途随时响应打断或新指令，无需等待上一段话完整输出。在演示中，模型能无缝切换逻辑，例如在执行计数任务时即时响应倒数指令。用户可通过模型选择器开启该功能，激活后语音气泡将变为黄色。此次升级彻底打破了传统语音助手的僵硬等待周期，大幅提升了人机协作的流畅度与沉浸感。目前该功能正处于测试阶段，正式上线已进入倒计时，旨在将ChatGPT从辅助工具升级为更具响应性的对话伙伴。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
